288 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The initial idea here was to see what are the market demands of architecture students but we are motivated to gain more data insights to make and refine the concept of the business through app testings and more data surveys.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [ 5 ]
>>
endobj

289 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Our research confirms a concentrated market: 50% of respondents are from MMCM, primarily 4th-year students. Demand is driven by the "All-Nighter" culture, with over 50% of CAD work finishing between 6:00 PM and 4:00 AM. The highest volume is in A3 drafts \(45%\) and 20"x30" final boards \(40%\), proving that students need a service that handles both rapid prototyping and high-end plotting during off-hours.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [ 6 ]
>>
endobj

